  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Elias given keys to bring to pass restoration of all things, D&C 27:6. Elias visited Zacharias, D&C 27:7. John the Baptist was filled with spirit of Elias, D&C 27:7. Elias to come to gather tribes of Israel and restore all things, D&C 77:9, 14. Elias commits dispensation of gospel of Abraham, D&C 110:12. Joseph F. Smith saw Elias, who was with Moses on Mount of Transfiguration, D&C 138:45.",
